## Why This Is Asked
This tests diagnosing streaming governance, tenant isolation, schema evolution, and automated remediation in real-time.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant schemas, Glue Schema Registry, data masking, Lake Formation permissions
- Parquet partitioning, Glue Catalog, lineage via EventBridge, testing strategies

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: mask email/phone in streaming records before land
function maskPII(record) {
  if (!record) return record;
  const r = {...record};
  if (r.user) {
    if (r.user.email) r.user.email = '***@***.com';
    if (r.user.phone) r.user.phone = '******';
  }
  return r;
}
```

